In this task, the focus is to explore the digital platforms that help in coding and collaboration.
Part A – Coding Practice:
I used HackerRank to solve a coding challenge for a beginner. This helped me improve my logical thinking and basic programming concepts. A screenshot of the completed challenge has been added to the task-3-platforms folder.
