From this task, I have learned how coding platforms like HackerRank assist in developing problem-solving skills. I have also come to know how Google Forms can be utilized in academic work, including quizzes and collaboration.

Task 4: Digital Communication & Social Media Etiquette
This task is all about learning the proper aspects of digital communication and etiquette in using social media sites.
I have developed a list of do’s and don’ts to be followed by students regarding proper digital communication and etiquette.
Do’s:
One must use proper language and maintain confidentiality regarding their information. One must also share information that is verified and true.
One must also maintain a professional attitude and think before posting something on social media sites.
Don’ts:
One must not post any fake information and must not use improper language.
One must not share their personal information and must not get into conflicts.
One must not post information that may harm their reputation.
Learning Outcome:
From this task, I have come to know the importance of proper digital communication and etiquette in using social media sites.

Task 5: Cyber Crime Awareness – UPI/Online Payment Fraud
This task is about becoming aware of cybercrimes, their effects, and learning how to avoid them. For this task, I have chosen the topic “UPI/Online Payment Fraud.”
UPI fraud is a type of cybercrime where cybercriminals deceive people by asking them to reveal their vital information, or they send fake payment requests. This type of cybercrime usually targets students, who are often active internet users. This cybercrime can cause financial, data, and mental losses for the victim.
I have also prepared a checklist with precautions to avoid cybercrimes, which includes not sharing vital information, verifying the sender’s request, avoiding unknown links, etc. This checklist will also include the ways to report cybercrimes, which are the National Cyber Crime Portal (cybercrime.gov.in) and the helpline number: 1930.
Learning Outcome:
I learned about cybercrimes through this task. I learned that if I am careful, I can avoid great financial losses.


This project has helped me to acquire some of the most vital digital literacy skills. I learned how to use digital tools, how to create a professional digital identity, how to communicate digitally, and how to avoid cybercrimes. These are the most vital digital literacy skills, which will be really helpful for me during my academic period. This project has also helped me to understand the importance of using digital tools responsibly.
